### Reusable New UI Widgets (`lib/widgets/new_ui/`)

#### [NEW] [promo_banner_card.dart](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/google/sync_app/lib/widgets/new_ui/promo_banner_card.dart)
- A gorgeous, split-row promo banner matching the layout of the discovery screen.
- Configurable background (`AppColors.secondaryGreen` or `AppColors.skyBlue`), custom discount texts, and a sleek dark button (`AppColors.textDark`) with micro-animations.

#### [NEW] [category_filter_tags.dart](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/google/sync_app/lib/widgets/new_ui/category_filter_tags.dart)
- A horizontal filter ribbon of capsules where selected categories are highlighted in `AppColors.primaryPink` with white icons, and unselected ones are white with subtle borders and dark gray icons.

#### [NEW] [service_discovery_card.dart](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/google/sync_app/lib/widgets/new_ui/service_discovery_card.dart)
- Premium featured cards built with a `Stack` layout.
- Base high-resolution Unsplash image clipped via `ClipRRect`, dark gradient overlay (`LinearGradient` transparent to `Colors.black87`), bold service title overlays, price per hour metrics, and a floating favorite/bookmark button at the top right.

#### [NEW] [curved_bottom_bar.dart](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/google/sync_app/lib/widgets/new_ui/curved_bottom_bar.dart)
- A custom-drawn persistent bottom navigation bar featuring a top `BoxShadow` and an elegant curved shape that cradles a central floating action button.

#### [NEW] [segmented_controller.dart](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/google/sync_app/lib/widgets/new_ui/segmented_controller.dart)
- A beautiful, sliding segmented pill controller ("Today", "Week", "Month") that transitions the active choice using an `AnimatedContainer` filled with `AppColors.textDark`.

#### [NEW] [weekly_date_ribbon.dart](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/google/sync_app/lib/widgets/new_ui/weekly_date_ribbon.dart)
- A horizontal date picker component. Days display shortened text above numerical day counters.
- Visual elements:
  - Active selection highlighted in a rounded capsule.
  - Underneath, conflict notification dots (orange/red `BoxShape.circle`) are rendered dynamically for days containing schedule collisions.

#### [NEW] [event_agenda_card.dart](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/google/sync_app/lib/widgets/new_ui/event_agenda_card.dart)
- Event items with custom layouts depending on their collision state:
  - **Approved Event:** Light green capsule badge for the timeframe, clean event title, and clickable meeting hyperlink.
  - **Conflicting Event:** Crimson/orange capsule badge (`alertOrange`), displaying "Conflict Hour".

#### [NEW] [radial_time_painter.dart](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/Desktop/google/sync_app/lib/widgets/new_ui/radial_time_painter.dart)
- The core custom radial widget. Implemented using a custom `CustomPainter` to draw:
  - Outer arc tracks representing schedule data: green for free/recommended slots, orange/red for conflicted slots.
  - Radial numbers 1 to 12.
  - A dark selector needle pointer radiating from the center.
  - A floating selected node containing the active integer hour with a glowing green dot underneath.
- Utilizes a wrapping `GestureDetector` to track drag coordinates, calculate radial angles using `atan2(y, x)`, and snap to the nearest hour dynamically with haptic-like responsiveness.

