## Verification Plan

### Automated & Manual Testing
- **Visual Integration Check:** Navigate through the New Home Dashboard and New Calendar screens, verifying that text alignments, card radii, search borders, and icons perfectly match the style guide.
- **Radial Trigonometry Verification:** Open the Radial Time Selection modal and drag the clock needle. Verify that the selector node snaps perfectly to standard hour intervals (1 to 12) using `atan2` mathematics and immediately updates the digital readout above.
- **Interactive Toggles:** Verify that tapping "AM"/"PM" or changing the segmented header ("Today", "Week", "Month") animates smoothly and updates the respective layout views.
- **Theme Stability:** Toggle between Light and Dark modes. Verify that the soft-morphism widgets adapt gracefully and retain their beautiful high-contrast borders and readable labels.
